      "Arise News (2022, April 26). EFCC moves against money laundering in Nigeria’s real estate sector. https://arise.tv/efcc-moves-against-money-laundering-in-nigerias-real-estate-sector",
      "BusinessDay (2025, August 7). Developers risk prosecution as EFCC targets real estate-linked fraud. https://businessday.ng/news/article/developers-risk-prosecution-as-efcc-targets-real-estate-linked-fraud/",
      "Companies and Allied Matters Act, 2020 (Nigeria).",
      "Economic and Financial Crimes Commission (2017, July 6). Court orders final forfeiture of $43.4m, £27.8, N23.2 to FG [News release]. https://efccnigeria.org/efcc/news-and-information/news-release/2571-court-orders-final-forfeiture-of-43-4m-27-8-n23-2-to-fg",
