      "Nairametrics (2025, October 24). FATF removes Nigeria from grey list, boosting investor confidence. https://nairametrics.com/2025/10/24/fatf-removes-nigeria-from-grey-list-boosting-investor-confidence/",
      "Olaniwun Ajayi (2022, August 30). Money Laundering (Prevention and Prohibition) Act 2022: Enhanced anti-money laundering regime in Nigeria. Mondaq. https://www.mondaq.com/article/1218416",
      "Pavestones Legal (2022, September 26). Key provisions in the Money Laundering (Prevention and Prohibition) Act, 2022. Mondaq. https://mondaq.com/nigeria/money-laundering/1233474/key-provisions-in-the-money-laundering-prevention-and-prohibition-act-2022",
